# Purpose Partners — SPA routing for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# The site uses React Router, so /about, /charities, /business and /contact are
# not real files. Without this line a static host returns 404 for all of them the
# moment someone refreshes the page or opens a link directly.
#
# Serve index.html for anything that is not a real asset, with a 200 (not a
# redirect), and let React Router read the URL.
#
# This must live at public/_redirects so Vite copies it into dist/ on build.

/*    /index.html   200
